  "working_tree": "Review follow-up: BoardVersions compact batched admission",
  "measurement": "Serial in-process reads with payload instrumentation included in latency; two warmups and nine raw samples. Bytes are uncompressed Erlang external-term encoding of decoded database result rows, a payload proxy, not PostgreSQL wire bytes or memory residency. p95/p99 are nearest-rank and equal the maximum at nine samples. No HTTP, browser, k6 or concurrent capacity claim.",
